{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the `timetable-helper` Skill to answer this timetable request: CSE-A Wednesday\n\n- Expect a batch (for example `CSE-A`) and a weekday. If either is missing, ask for it instead of guessing.\n- Run the Skill's lookup script and show the result as a table with Time, Course, Room and Faculty columns.\n- If no rows come back, say there are no classes for that batch and day. Do not invent any.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"603efdcd-753b-4087-a4b8-6e803c3fd073","uuid":"a39e8bef-efb0-4e11-aec2-c163d58f98cf","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:43:55.054Z","isSynthetic":true}
